          are no longer in proceedings, provide the date of action. If you are currently
          in proceedings, type or print “Current” in the appropriate date field. Select
          all applicable boxes. Use the space provided in Part 8. Additional Information
          to provide an explanation. 7. C. Select Exclusion Proceedings.
      old_name: proceedings_type
      adjudicated: proposed
